<title>HONG KONG: Chengdu Telecom yr net loss 11.4 mln yuan.</title>
<headline>Chengdu Telecom yr net loss 11.4 mln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.028 loss vs 0.039 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  5.92 loss  vs 7.11 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    11.39 loss vs 15.78 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     628.59     vs 589.59</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chengdu Telecommunications Cable</p>
<p>				     Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Chengdu produces telecommunications equipment including copper and optical fibre cables and cable joining sleeves.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for dimunution in value of obsolete machinery and equipment.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 0.02 yuan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
